{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23443","headline":"荅微之咏怀见寄 · 白居易","name":"荅微之咏怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合中同直前春事，船里相逢昨日情。\n分袂二年劳梦寐，并牀三宿话平生。\n紫微半畔辞宫阙，沧海西头对郡城。\n聚散穷通何足道，醉来一曲放歌行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}